&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left"&gt;SoftBank Vision Fund II-2 L.P.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left"&gt;SBLA Latin America Fund LLC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
